id=disable_hdr
name=Disable HDR
version=v2.0.0
versionCode=2
author=your-name-here
description=Hides HDR support from apps via a self-contained Zygisk module (LSPlant + Dobby, statically linked - no LSPosed required). Needs KernelSU + a Zygisk provider (ZygiskNext or ReZygisk). WebUI lets you scope it to specific apps.
